      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i manage a rental property in phoenix and one of the tenants is complaining that the ac is running all the time but her master bedroom stays really hot compared to the rest of the house. what are some common reasons this happens?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Several things could cause a hot bedroom while the AC runs. Common issues include poor insulation or window sealing in that specific room, creating a heat sink. Additionally, direct sunlight hitting the master bedroom or blockages in the ductwork leading to that room can significantly raise the temperature. You might want to check the HVAC registers and windows in that bedroom first.",
