    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just frustrating because it's like something is actively working against the cooling in that one spot. are there any other weird variables that could cause a specific room to stay hot even if the vents are open? like maybe some weird pressure issues or something unexpected in the vents?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
